Edit distance implementation. Use a simple O(n*m) DP. Optimize by using two rows.

```java
private static int editDistance(String s, String t) {
    int n = s.length();
    int m = t.length();
    if (n == 0) return m;
    if (m == 0) return n;
    int[] prev = new int[m + 1];
    int[] curr = new int[m + 1];
    for (int j = 0; j <= m; j++) {
        prev[j] = j;
    }
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        curr[0] = i;
        char sc = s.charAt(i - 1);
        for (int j = 1; j <= m; j++) {
            int cost = sc == t.charAt(j - 1) ? 0 : 1;
            curr[j] = Math.min(Math.min(curr[j - 1] + 1, prev[j] + 1), prev[j - 1] + cost);
        }
        int[] tmp = prev;
        prev = curr;
        curr = tmp;
    }
    return prev[m];
}
```

